 "description": "The Saffier SE 28 Leopard is a bold 28-foot daysailer that delivers speed, thrill and comfort with the ease of single-handed sailing. Fast, fun and fully customizable, she lets you sail exactly how you want. Choose between electric or diesel propulsion, a sporty tiller or comfortable dual steering wheels. Even the foredeck can be tailored to your needs: hatch for more ventilation, solar panel to charge service batteries or Esthec for extra freedom to move.\nYour sailboat, your choice. Experience sailing on your terms with the Saffier SE 28 Leopard.",
 "credits": [
  {
   "label": "Design",
   "value": "D. Hennevanger | Kees van de Stadt"
  }
 ],
 "awards": [],
 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "New hull design",
   "intro": "The Saffier SE 28 Leopard features a completely new hull design for even faster sailing upwind and downwind.\nHer modern lines, wide beam and flat underwater sections deliver speed, stability and control in all conditions. Built to combine thrilling performance with safety and comfort, the Saffier SE 28 Leopard is more than just a daysailer, she’s your invitation to sail faster and further.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Your weekend getaway",
   "intro": "The SE 28 Leopard takes daysailing to the next level with comfort for overnight trips.\nBelow deck you’ll find four cozy and comfortable berths, a galley with fridge, sink and coffee machine, plus a practical toilet. Her completely new interior layout is designed with smart use of space, making life aboard easy and enjoyable. After a day of sailing, unwind in comfort and wake up ready for another adventure.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Design your own Saffier SE 28 Leopard",
   "intro": "The Saffier SE 28 Leopard is built around your choice.\nElectric or diesel propulsion, a sporty tiller or dual steering wheels, foredeck options with hatch, solar panel or Esthec, every detail can be tailored to your preferences. Each option is seamlessly integrated into the design, so no matter how you configure her, she remains balanced, stylish and unmistakably Saffier Yachts. With so many ways to make her your own, the Saffier SE 28 Leopard lets you define how you sail.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Lake or sea",
   "intro": "Wherever you sail, the Saffier SE 28 Leopard feels at home.\nAgile and responsive on lakes, powerful and confident on open waters, she handles light breezes and strong winds with equal ease. A powerful rig and efficient sail plan keep her fast and fun, while her stability ensures comfort and control. Designed to adapt to your sailing life, the Saffier SE 28 Leopard brings freedom on every horizon.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Easy transportable",
   "intro": "Lightweight and cleverly built, the Saffier SE 28 Leopard can be trailered, launched and rigged with ease, giving you the freedom to sail wherever you like.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Seldén hardware",
   "intro": "Premium Seldén hardware, including rewind winches(opt.), delivers smooth handling and reliable performance, making every sail effortless and enjoyable.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Powerful rig- and sailplan",
   "intro": "The powerful rig and balanced sailplan ensure impressive speed and full control in all conditions, with an optional carbon mast for even greater stiffness and weight reduction.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  },
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Comfortable cockpit",
   "intro": "The Saffier SE 28 Leopard’s cockpit is designed for pure comfort and control. Ergonomic seating and smart layout make sailing effortless and relaxing.",
   "items": [],
   "images": []
  }
 ],
